 movement skills to the limit.\n\nProject Rust focuses on:\n\n\u2022 Immersive arm-based locomotion\n\u2022 Physical movement mechanics\n\u2022 Skill-based traversal\n\u2022 Fast and fluid VR gameplay\n\nEvery movement is powered by you. The more you move, the faster you go.\n\nStep into Project Rust and experience locomotion in a whole new way.", "short_description": "Fast paced arm swing locomotion survival experience where you move using your real arms. Explore, survive, and test your movement skills in Project Rust."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-rust/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "project rust", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-rust/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26471728352413452"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26462119476707673", "version": "AsteroidsFangameTemplate"}, "id": "1614752446234210", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBina